OL,5,G0450 Teleshopping
OL,6,G0700 Teleshopping
OL,7,G0900 Four in a Bed
OL,8,     FThe competition kicks off at The
OL,9,     FRed Lion in Charing Heath, Kent,
OL,10,     Fwhere the B&Bers are treated to a
OL,11,     Fmasterclass in hospitality. And
OL,12,     Fone guest reveals their combative
OL,13,     Fside.
OL,14,G0930 Four in a Bed
OL,15,     FIn East Sussex, Dean and Becky
OL,16,     Fhope their unique glamping digs,
OL,17,     FGlamp in Style - including a
OL,18,     Fconverted army truck and a
OL,19,     Fhorsebox - will have the B&Bers
OL,20,     Fraving. If only...
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG1/12
