OL,5,G1100 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FPayment day promises to be a fiery
OL,7,     Faffair, with two sets of B&Bers
OL,8,     Fset for a head-on collision about
OL,9,     Ftheir marking. And then we find
OL,10,     Fout who's won.
OL,11,G1130 Four in a Bed
OL,12,     FEnvironmentally-friendly couple
OL,13,     FIan and Jayne host first, at The
OL,14,     FSchool House B&B in Pencader,
OL,15,     FCarmarthenshire. At dinner,
OL,16,     Feyebrows are raised at two
OL,17,     Fstraight-talking guests.
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG3/12
