OL,5,G1200 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FNeil and Jo welcome their rivals
OL,7,     Fto Cathedral 73 in Cardiff. Their
OL,8,     Fguests are wowed by the glamorous
OL,9,     Frooms, but the extra charges for
OL,10,     Fparking and breakfast prove hard
OL,11,     Fto swallow.
OL,12,G1230 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FGolfer Raj hosts at the Leafy
OL,14,     FSuburban B&B in Hertfordshire,
OL,15,     Fwhere the house rules include
OL,16,     Fremoving your shoes at the door.
OL,17,     FNeil and Jo aren't impressed by a
OL,18,     Fsurprise visitor in their bed.
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG4/12
