OL,5,G1300 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FThe final visit is to The
OL,7,     FWellington Inn in Hertfordshire,
OL,8,     Fwhere resources manager Felicity
OL,9,     FRainbow's spiritual approach to
OL,10,     Fhosting includes cleansing the
OL,11,     Frooms' auras.
OL,12,G1330 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FIt's the final day of the
OL,14,     Fcompetition and the B&Bers meet
OL,15,     Ffor the last time to find out how
OL,16,     Fmuch they've been paid and to
OL,17,     Fsettle some scores. After bitter
OL,18,     Frebukes, the winner is announced.
