OL,5,G1400 Location, Location, Location
OL,6,     FPhil's beside the seaside and
OL,7,     FKirstie covers the countryside as
OL,8,     Fthey scour Norfolk for homes for
OL,9,     Ftwo young-at-heart pensioners and
OL,10,     Fa couple who've been house-hunting
OL,11,     Ffor a year.
OL,12,G1500 Kirstie and Phil's Love It or...
OL,13,     F...List It: Brilliant Builds: The
OL,14,     Fduo explore what to do when your
OL,15,     Fproperty problems just can't be
OL,16,     Ffixed, and revisit a garden that
OL,17,     Fproved to be a hill too steep to
OL,18,     Fclimb.
