OL,5,G1600 A Place in the Sun
OL,6,     FGolf-loving couple Lynn and Mike
OL,7,     Ffrom Southampton have been
OL,8,     Fvisiting Spain for 40 years and
OL,9,     Fnow want to buy a holiday home
OL,10,     Fthere. Danni Menzies shows them
OL,11,     Ffive options for their #60,000.
OL,12,G1700 A Place in the Sun
OL,13,     FLaura Hamilton helps Tamsin and
OL,14,     Fher best friend Emma search for a
OL,15,     Fholiday bolthole for Tamsin on the
OL,16,     FGreek island of Crete, on a budget
OL,17,     Fof #100,000.
